{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/60","id":5410750576,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVjVyDc8AAAABQoGAcA","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/60","diff_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/60.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/60.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/60","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/60/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/60/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/60/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/statuses/43471705e469f09e55658660b8b9f921401a00d4","number":60,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"test(media): verify legal-hold and deletion race serialization","user":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Security findings and fixes\n\n1. **Room media delivery:** require an active room and recheck the viewer's current member-account standing before issuing a signed URL. A stale ID token for a suspended/banned member or a closed room cannot use an existing membership record to obtain media.\n2. **Room message reads:** recheck the current member account status on every read; a suspended/banned account cannot read room history merely because a membership document remains.\n3. **Legal-hold/deletion race:** Emulator test races the real Owner legal-hold callable against permanent deletion. Exactly one transaction must win; a successful hold preserves the derivative, while a successful deletion blocks later hold placement.\n4. **Late derivative cleanup:** tombstone retry test proves a late safe derivative is removed by exact recorded object name after an earlier deletion.\n5. Added Emulator regressions for suspended room members, closed rooms, membership removal, legal-hold/deletion serialization and late-derivative tombstone retry.\n\n## Safety\n- Server-mediated, generation-pinned delivery remains in place.\n- Storage client rules remain default-deny.\n- No production bucket, Firebase deployment, billing, retention activation or external E2E/load test.\n- Draft only; exact-head Validate Mawda and Domain Regression must pass before merge.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T09:09:45Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:54:30Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T09:27:34Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T09:27:34Z","merge_commit_sha":"d10bad92ee0ddf2420a80196f7a1136acbf806b6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"p